Keeps this directory in git.

pubspec.yaml declares `assets/fonts/` as an asset directory, and Flutter fails the
build when a declared directory does not exist. Git does not track empty
directories, so without this file a fresh checkout (CI included) has no
assets/fonts/ and the build breaks.

The directory is otherwise optional: drop IBMPlexSans-Regular.ttf and
IBMPlexSans-Bold.ttf here to give the PDF reports full Unicode coverage. When
they are absent, lib/report/report_fonts.dart returns no theme and dart_pdf
falls back to the built-in Helvetica, which covers Latin-1 (including the `µ` of
`µs`) but not arbitrary clinical notes. See tablet/README.md.
